<div class="text-center about">
  <h1>About Us</h1>
</div>
<!-- Section 1 -->
<section class="content">
  <div class="row g-0 align-items-center">
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
      <div class="content-text">
        <h2 data-aos="fade-up">Discover New Flavors, Discover New Possibilities</h2>
        <p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
          Our website is a place for anyone who loves food and wants to explore recipes from different parts of the world. Through a variety of dishes and ingredients, readers can expand their culinary knowledge while discovering new ideas
          to try in their own kitchen. Whether you are looking for inspiration for your next meal or simply curious about unfamiliar dishes, we hope every recipe can encourage you to explore, experiment, and create something of your own.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="200">
      <img src="/img/cooking.jpg" alt="discover" class="content-img img-fluid" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<!-- End Section 1 -->
<!-- Section 2 -->
<section class="content">
  <div class="row g-0 align-items-center">
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
      <div class="content-text">
        <h2 data-aos="fade-up">Good Food Should Be Delicious and Nutritious</h2>
        <p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
          We believe that nutritious food does not have to be boring or complicated. By providing inspiration for delicious and balanced meals, we aim to support the spirit of the Free Nutritious Meals (MBG) program beyond the school
          environment. Everyone deserves access to meals that are not only enjoyable to eat but also provide the nourishment needed to support a healthy and active lifestyle. Through our collection of recipes, we hope to inspire readers to
          make better food choices in their everyday lives.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="200">
      <img src="/img/mbg.jpg" alt="mbg" class="content-img img-fluid" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<!-- End Section 2 -->
<!-- Section 3 -->
<section class="content">
  <div class="row g-0 align-items-center">
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
      <div class="content-text">
        <h2 data-aos="fade-up">Every Recipe Can Become the Start of a Business Idea</h2>
        <p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
          Food is more than something we eat—it can also become an opportunity to create and grow. Our website aims to inspire readers who are interested in the culinary industry by introducing them to different dishes, ingredients, and
          food concepts from around the world. A recipe discovered here could become the foundation for a home-based food business, catering service, food product, or even a unique restaurant concept. We hope these culinary discoveries can
          spark creativity and encourage readers to turn their passion for food into meaningful opportunities.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="200">
      <img src="/img/cookingbusiness.jpg" alt="business" class="content-img img-fluid" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<!-- End Section 3 -->
<!-- Section 4 -->
<section class="content">
  <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
      <div class="content-text">
        <h2 data-aos="fade-up">Experience the World Through Food</h2>
        <p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
          Every dish carries a story about the people and culture behind it. The ingredients, cooking methods, traditions, and ways of serving food can reveal unique aspects of life in different parts of the world. By exploring
          international cuisine, readers can experience a small piece of these cultures without having to travel thousands of miles. We bring those culinary experiences closer to you, so that a simple meal at your table can also become a
          journey of discovery.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="200">
      <img src="/img/internationaldish.jpg" alt="interdish" class="content-img img-fluid" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<!-- End Section 4 -->
